# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .gitignore — aios-kit
#
# The repo carries the BRAIN: manual, context, skills, knowledge.
# It never carries deliverables, binaries, or secrets.
# A 2 GB repo is unusable from a phone or a cloud session.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Secrets and local config
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/settings.local.json
*.pem
*.key
credentials.json
.claude.json
*token*.json
*secret*
*.oat

# OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Dependencies and build output
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
dist/
build/

# Heavy deliverables — these live in your drive, not in git
*.pdf
*.docx
*.xlsx
*.pptx
*.mp4
*.mov
*.zip
